    "title": "How Two Clintonville Siblings Brought Back Independence Day Fun - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kathy Lynn Gray ,\n1 days ago Clintonville lost its Fourth of July celebration in 2020. Two siblings brought it back, fireworks and all. See what’s in store this year. When the organizers of the annual July Fourth Clintonville fireworks extravaganza bowed out and asked younger community members to take over after 2019, no one stepped up, even after COVID vaccines made the longtime gathering at Whetstone Park possible again. Read full article\n2",
